SporkHack: separate immutable data from private writable Unix state.

Modified by the tay Guix channel, 2026-10-06.  Distributed under the
NetHack General Public License (upstream dat/license).  Retain ordinary
save/restore, livelog, wish tracking, whereis and game-end dumps; route
native writable prefixes and the two formerly absolute dgamelaunch paths
to the launcher's user-owned playground.  Do not add a test mode or audio
backend.  Original copyright and license headers remain intact.

